title Cassette recording through the sound server (T6e): the format carries (server) for the whole take (strip), the notice that the card is in use shows for 4 s
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO recording
env CASSETTE_DEMO_SERVER 1
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 600
shot server-recording
@480x320,640x480 expect text "TAKE 007 · 48k/16 WAV (server) · 12 h 40 left"
@320x480 expect text "(server) 12 h 40"
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
